            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The authors approach a subject keen to neuroophthalmologists, which is becoming more and more frequent with the overuse of VTU (videoterminal unit). They hope to better understand the headache (from an ophthalmic point of view), and how to diagnose it better and faster.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
